      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Today, you have a unique adventure awaiting you! A walk over the abyss.\n\nSkyglass is located in the neighboring town of Canela and is the largest attraction of its kind in Latin America! A 36-meter glass platform hangs over the picturesque Ferradura Valley (at a height of about 360 meters). And for the most fearless, there is an opportunity to ride in special suspended chairs over the abyss. \n\nTour to Cascata waterfall.\n\nIn the second half of the day, transfer to Praia Grande. This town is located near the main attraction of the region – the Canyons of Cambará do Sul. They are located on the border between the states of Rio Grande do Sul and Santa Catarina and are one of the most beautiful places on the planet. Considered the largest canyon in Latin America, with Itaimbezinho and Fortaleza Canyons, this place attracts visitors in search of unforgettable experiences."
    },
